<title>Yemen and the Red Sea: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/yemen/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-yemen-2026-11-20T21:23:34.269Z</guid>
<pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 21:23:34 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Houthis seized the Bab al-Mandeb strait and nearby positions after Yemeni government troops withdrew, putting them about 60 km from Aden. Saudi-backed forces responded with intensified air strikes on dozens of Houthi sites and increased pressure on Taiz. The Houthis launched missile attacks that damaged the Saudi sovereign wealth fund headquarters and the tallest tower in Riyadh, and the coalition intercepted further missiles aimed at the capital and southern Saudi Arabia. The conflict caused 918 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/11/1168830&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipwFBVV95cUxNQUE1UEFGeklRZGtscWJhNkdxRWpyWHkwQ29IcVQ1Umc2VHlkWlJGZzZPTC00SFl2a3J0SXY3TGo0X0t2a3A5ckMzbmtZXy1mYzdoa0F5Vmo1TGFaU1RIbEZHak5iTi1oRXhWWF9CbWZ2QWFLRG1HSG5Rc1dSbHZlaGNNSDlvZ2RiekJzbnpqMC1aektLZU1MSHBWN25PYURzUGduTjhURQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijwFBVV95cUxORThXT3I5QnpTVGwxaTdQek9zdk1MUUxYTWhqbTItZFNHNGZZMFdGdVpURWRSdE1NbDBZQmVxVkV6MF9BSHBFRWpIQ1Zlb2NoSFRTM09ldmRlTEU5U3FTUzFvUEtTTnMtZjMtM1M1WTNfWmxpMVdNbXhKeGJ3OTdUVTJQN0I5NnFFdmN0ZnpxYw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sky News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirwFBVV95cUxOVjA0eExpTEFzQjhqUV9XS1g4bXVPeURpMmQ4ZXBNZG1nQUxmRnZ1anhHWFhYTHM1SjlyUV9PTi04UFRmLXZVVDFFSGVWWVN0bTVlSV9mUGZHaUp3QTFyTHhvRm4zQjg4WkdYOTlsaTNKZURQMGFlTWx4aFk1MFNEVDB6V2hEeGZGX3FOZ2RFejk4STc3QUhSWGQ5cUFST25rd1QtbFcwWGtqZjNfZGUw?oc=5&quot;&gt;UA.NEWS&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMifEFVX3lxTFBKT3Q1Z0xzTDVocWl6WFBjRmZGbExWTHBQdk